---
/**
 * Variant 23: Spotlight Layout + Ultra Luxury Colors
 * V3 layout (Photo pile, clean structure) with V6 colors (Gold + Navy)
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Variante 23 - Spotlight × Luxury | Mobile Kinderosteopathie Leipzig</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      /* V6 Luxury Colors */
      --color-gold: #c9a962;
      --color-gold-light: #d4ba7a;
      --color-gold-dark: #a8893d;
      --color-navy: #0a1628;
      --color-navy-light: #132238;
      --color-navy-dark: #060d18;
      --color-cream: #f9f7f3;
      --color-cream-dark: #ebe7df;

      /* Semantic mappings */
      --color-bg: var(--color-cream);
      --color-bg-secondary: var(--color-cream-dark);
      --color-border: rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.15);
      --color-text-primary: var(--color-navy);
      --color-text-secondary: rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.65);
      --color-text-muted: rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.45);
      --color-accent: var(--color-gold);
      --color-accent-hover: var(--color-gold-dark);

      --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --font-serif: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      color: var(--color-text-primary);
      background: var(--color-bg);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .container-sm {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      padding: 32px 0;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 50;
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.25);
    }

    .avatar img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: saturate(0.9);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
      padding: 4px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    }

    .nav a {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: var(--color-text-primary);
      background: var(--color-cream);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.15);
    }

    .nav a.active {
      background: var(--color-cream);
      color: var(--color-text-primary);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.15);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 48px 0 80px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .hero-content {
      padding-top: 40px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .hero-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }

    .hero-link:hover {
      color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    }

    .hero-link svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
    }

    /* Photo Pile */
    .photo-pile {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: -40px;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .photo-pile-item {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 220px;
      aspect-ratio: 9/10;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.15), 0 4px 8px rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1);
      background: var(--color-cream-dark);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .photo-pile-item:hover {
      z-index: 10;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.2), 0 8px 16px rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.15);
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(1) {
      transform: rotate(-6deg) translateY(20px);
      margin-right: -30px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(1):hover {
      transform: rotate(-3deg) translateY(10px) scale(1.02);
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(2) {
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(2):hover {
      transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.02);
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(3) {
      transform: rotate(3deg) translateY(30px);
      margin-left: -30px;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(3):hover {
      transform: rotate(1deg) translateY(20px) scale(1.02);
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(4) {
      transform: rotate(7deg) translateY(10px);
      margin-left: -35px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .photo-pile-item:nth-child(4):hover {
      transform: rotate(4deg) translateY(0px) scale(1.02);
    }

    .photo-pile-item img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: saturate(0.85) contrast(1.05);
    }

    /* Content Sections */
    .section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-header p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* Feature List */
    .feature-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .feature-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      background: var(--color-cream-dark);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .feature-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
    }

    .feature-content h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .feature-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* About Section */
    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-image {
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.15);
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    }

    .about-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: saturate(0.85);
    }

    .about-content {
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .about-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .credentials-simple {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px 32px;
    }

    .credential-tag {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .credential-tag::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: var(--color-gold);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    /* CTA Section */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .cta-card {
      background: var(--color-navy);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 64px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cta-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 0%, rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.2) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 100%, rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);
    }

    .cta-card h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .cta-card p {
      color: rgba(249, 247, 243, 0.7);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      position: relative;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--color-gold);
      color: var(--color-navy);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--color-gold-light);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-white {
      background: var(--color-cream);
      color: var(--color-navy);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    }

    .btn-white:hover {
      background: var(--color-cream-dark);
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding: 48px 0;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-navy);
    }

    .footer-copy {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    /* Back link */
    .back-link {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--color-navy);
      color: var(--color-cream);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      z-index: 100;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(10, 22, 40, 0.25);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: var(--color-navy-light);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
      }
      .photo-pile {
        order: -1;
      }
      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      .about-image {
        max-width: 280px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav { display: none; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
      .photo-pile-item { width: 140px; }
      .photo-pile-item:nth-child(4) { display: none; }
      .cta-card { padding: 48px 24px; }
      .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; text-align: center; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .photo-pile-item { width: 110px; }
      .photo-pile-item:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/project/designs" class="back-link">← Alle Varianten</a>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="#" class="avatar">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=200&h=200&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="Susanne Hoppe" />
        </a>
        <nav class="nav">
          <a href="#" class="active">Home</a>
          <a href="#">Über mich</a>
          <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
          <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Termin anfragen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Mobile Kinderosteopathie in Leipzig – sanft, einfühlsam, bei Ihnen zuhause.</h1>
          <p>
            Ich bin Susanne Hoppe, Physiotherapeutin und zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin.
            Mit über 20 Jahren Erfahrung behandle ich Säuglinge und Kinder mit sanften,
            kindgerechten Methoden – in der vertrauten Umgebung Ihres Zuhauses.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-links">
            <a href="#" class="hero-link">
              <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
              </svg>
              Anrufen
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="hero-link">
              <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              E-Mail
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="hero-link">
              <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              </svg>
              Leipzig
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-pile">
          <div class="photo-pile-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544126592-807ade215a0b?w=400&h=450&fit=crop" alt="Kinderosteopathie" />
          </div>
          <div class="photo-pile-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587654780291-39c9404d746b?w=400&h=450&fit=crop" alt="Baby Behandlung" />
          </div>
          <div class="photo-pile-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555252333-9f8e92e65df9?w=400&h=450&fit=crop" alt="Familie" />
          </div>
          <div class="photo-pile-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609220136736-443140cffec6?w=400&h=450&fit=crop" alt="Zuhause" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-sm">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Warum mobile Kinderosteopathie?</h2>
        <p>Ihr Kind profitiert von einer entspannten Behandlung in vertrauter Umgebung.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-list">
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <h3>Behandlung bei Ihnen zuhause</h3>
            <p>Kein Stress mit Anfahrt und Wartezeiten. Ihr Kind kann in seiner gewohnten Umgebung bleiben – entspannter für alle.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <h3>Flexible Termingestaltung</h3>
            <p>Termine, die zu Ihrem Familienalltag passen – auch wenn der Schlafrhythmus mal wieder alles durcheinanderbringt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <h3>Sanfte, kindgerechte Methoden</h3>
            <p>Osteopathische Techniken speziell für Säuglinge und Kinder – behutsam, respektvoll und immer im Tempo Ihres Kindes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-content">
            <h3>20+ Jahre Erfahrung</h3>
            <p>Fundierte Ausbildung und langjährige Praxiserfahrung in der Arbeit mit Kindern – als Physiotherapeutin und Osteopathin.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=500&h=650&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="Susanne Hoppe" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Über mich</h2>
          <p>
            Mein Name ist Susanne Hoppe. Seit über 20 Jahren arbeite ich mit Kindern –
            zunächst als Physiotherapeutin, heute als zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin.
          </p>
          <p>
            Was mich antreibt? Die Überzeugung, dass jedes Kind die bestmögliche Unterstützung
            verdient. Und die Erfahrung, dass eine Behandlung in vertrauter Umgebung oft
            wirksamer ist als in einer fremden Praxis.
          </p>
          <p>
            Deshalb komme ich zu Ihnen nach Hause – damit Ihr Kind entspannt bleiben kann
            und wir in Ruhe arbeiten können.
          </p>

          <div class="credentials-simple">
            <span class="credential-tag">Staatl. gepr. Physiotherapeutin</span>
            <span class="credential-tag">Zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin</span>
            <span class="credential-tag">20+ Jahre Erfahrung</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container-sm">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <h2>Haben Sie Fragen?</h2>
        <p>
          Ich freue mich auf Ihre Nachricht und beantworte gerne alle Fragen
          rund um die osteopathische Behandlung Ihres Kindes.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-white">Kontakt aufnehmen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-inner">
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="#">Home</a>
          <a href="#">Über mich</a>
          <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
